0028: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0029:     """
0030:     Connect every pair of aligned teal marker pixels by painting the gap between them green.
0031: 
0032:     Input structure
0033:     - The grid has a dominant background color and exactly one non-background marker color.
0034:     - Marker pixels are isolated endpoints; any row or column contains zero, one, or two markers.
0035:     - Green is absent from the input and is reserved for the added connector segments.
0036: 
0037:     Rule
0038:     - Preserve the input grid.
0039:     - For each row with exactly two markers, paint the background pixels strictly between them green.
0040:     - For each column with exactly two markers, paint the background pixels strictly between them green.
