/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:44:   - "Wall placement determines segment length" is false now; segment length is fixed, and walls
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:49:   - Arrows, traversed cells, and wall cells are pairwise disjoint and in-bounds.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:50:   - Planned wall cells are forbidden from lying on the diagonal path.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:51:   - Auto-turn endpoints are kept free of side walls so the auto-turn is unambiguous.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:57:   - Fixed-length turning is visible because at least one turn occurs with no nearby wall.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:58:   - Wall-driven recoloring still appears elsewhere, so the wall objects remain meaningful.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:61:   - No overlaps are allowed among arrows, walls, or traversed cells.
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/23/code.py:66:   - Colors change only at wall-turn endpoints, never at auto-turns.
